    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/3e242b2c35e4c204dbc2b4e4892c1caf.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/3e242b2c35e4c204dbc2b4e4892c1caf.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/3e242b2c35e4c204dbc2b4e4892c1caf.mp4?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Tessy, a final-year microbiology student who wakes up trapped in a locked university administrative building. In your desperate attempt to escape, you uncover a grand conspiracy and unravel the sinister intentions of a mysterious organization. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, <i>CloserLook VR</i> allows players to fully inhabit its immersive world, piece together its gripping narrative, and solve unique, story-driven puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/c62cd6bd4e989c0b47157e17fc8e4e84.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/c62cd6bd4e989c0b47157e17fc8e4e84.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment you wake up in the quiet departmental library, every step forward reveals layers of mystery and intrigue. As you transition from the mundane to the mysterious, solving intricate puzzles becomes the key to unlocking the secrets of this place. Each action pulls you deeper into a beautifully rendered West African setting, rich with history and culture. Along the way, you\u2019ll recover stolen artifacts, piece together untold stories, and face challenges that test your wit and perseverance, making every moment an unforgettable part of your journey to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/90b53d2356ac6e73c6ac90b26238ce72.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/90b53d2356ac6e73c6ac90b26238ce72.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/90b53d2356ac6e73c6ac90b26238ce72.mp4?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Narrative:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a deeply layered story with themes of corruption, exploitation, and unexpected twists. As you delve deeper, question motives and reconsider your initial assumptions as you discover a truth that is both intriguing and unsettling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive and Engaging Puzzles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your observation and intuition with puzzles that seamlessly integrate into the narrative. Use tools and key items to navigate a unique loactions designed to keep you trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique VR Experience:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CloserLook VR</i> pushes the boundaries of virtual reality immersion. With unparalleled attention to detail, it offers a custom-crafted world and story designed to captivate and immerse you from beginning to end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/6aa975590db36a568004875664133708.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/6aa975590db36a568004875664133708.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/6aa975590db36a568004875664133708.mp4?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a meticulously crafted world set in modern West Africa with <i>CloserLook VR: Oldways</i>, an immersive story-driven adventure designed for VR. Built entirely from custom assets by a solo developer, this game offers an unparalleled level of detail and immersion in the VR medium.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/3e242b2c35e4c204dbc2b4e4892c1caf.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/3e242b2c35e4c204dbc2b4e4892c1caf.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/3e242b2c35e4c204dbc2b4e4892c1caf.mp4?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Tessy, a final-year microbiology student who wakes up trapped in a locked university administrative building. In your desperate attempt to escape, you uncover a grand conspiracy and unravel the sinister intentions of a mysterious organization. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, <i>CloserLook VR</i> allows players to fully inhabit its immersive world, piece together its gripping narrative, and solve unique, story-driven puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/c62cd6bd4e989c0b47157e17fc8e4e84.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/c62cd6bd4e989c0b47157e17fc8e4e84.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment you wake up in the quiet departmental library, every step forward reveals layers of mystery and intrigue. As you transition from the mundane to the mysterious, solving intricate puzzles becomes the key to unlocking the secrets of this place. Each action pulls you deeper into a beautifully rendered West African setting, rich with history and culture. Along the way, you\u2019ll recover stolen artifacts, piece together untold stories, and face challenges that test your wit and perseverance, making every moment an unforgettable part of your journey to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/90b53d2356ac6e73c6ac90b26238ce72.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/90b53d2356ac6e73c6ac90b26238ce72.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/90b53d2356ac6e73c6ac90b26238ce72.mp4?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Narrative:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a deeply layered story with themes of corruption, exploitation, and unexpected twists. As you delve deeper, question motives and reconsider your initial assumptions as you discover a truth that is both intriguing and unsettling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive and Engaging Puzzles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your observation and intuition with puzzles that seamlessly integrate into the narrative. Use tools and key items to navigate a unique loactions designed to keep you trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique VR Experience:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CloserLook VR</i> pushes the boundaries of virtual reality immersion. With unparalleled attention to detail, it offers a custom-crafted world and story designed to captivate and immerse you from beginning to end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/6aa975590db36a568004875664133708.poster.avif?t=1747399979\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/6aa975590db36a568004875664133708.webm?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480840/extras/6aa975590db36a568004875664133708.mp4?t=1747399979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a meticulously crafted world set in modern West Africa with <i>CloserLook VR: Oldways</i>, an immersive story-driven adventure designed for VR. Built entirely from custom assets by a solo developer, this game offers an unparalleled level of detail and immersion in the VR medium.</p>",
    "short_description": "CloserLook VR: Oldways is a story-driven VR adventure set in modern-day West Africa. Trapped in a university building, explore secret locations, solve puzzles, and uncover a gripping narrative of exploitation, corruption, and betrayal.",
